, amikor az ellenfélnek sikerült megfordítani a meccset. Összességében egyénileg és csapatszinten is rendkívül magas szinten futballoztunk, a srácok mindent kiadtak magukból! Gratulálok a csapatnak!"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"b2463d6b22b8","_type":"image","url":"/archiv/kepek/02334f647410cd25d191f95818bc7e6043119e5f-1000x657.webp"},{"_key":"f71736ad9f12","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"f71736ad9f120","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"U8 Sátor Kupa"},{"_key":"f71736ad9f121","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n2019.12.01., vasárnap 08.15\nGödöllői Sportcentrum\n2100 Gödöllő, Táncsics Mihály út 5."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"d2da700e07ca0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Összeállítás:"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" Izsó, Tóth, Tóth-Bozsó, Forgács, Tamasi, Murányi, Vaskó\n\n"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca2","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Eredmények:"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n\n"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Csoportmérkőzések:"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n\n"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca6","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Vasas Kubala Akadémia - III. Ker. TVE: 5-0"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca7","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca8","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Gólszerzők"},{"_key":"d2da700e07ca9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":": Tóth, Murányi, Tamasi (2), Bozsó"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"84145abd1aef","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"84145abd1aef0","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Vasas Kubala Akadémia - Várda LA: 1-0"},{"_key":"84145abd1aef1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"84145abd1aef2","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Gólszerző:"},{"_key":"84145abd1aef3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" Izsó\n\n"},{"_key":"84145abd1aef4","_type":